(rail-guidance-trace)
*title Named variable-mass rail guidance trace
*sixdof
*method rk45-var variable-mass
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84
*file rail_guidance_trace.dat time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt

*trajectory 1 rail_vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=2000 alt=0 lat=0 long=0 vel=0 gama=90 psi=90
  *print time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt plength q_rail azm elev
  *segment 1 guided-launch
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.01
    *mass xcg=0 ixx=20 iyy=20 izz=5
    *aero sref=1.069 lrefx=1.16667 lrefy=1.16667 caxial=0.6 cnormal=0.12
    *prop x=-14.46 y=0 z=0 thrust=50000 mdot=6
    *rail launch azm=325 elev=70 cfstat=0.12 cfslid=0.01
    *increment q_rail=-0.5
    *when plength>30 goto 2
  *segment 2 free-flight
    *aero caxial=0.2 cnormal=0.05
    *when alt<0 stop
*end
